"after go mod:\nSKILL.mod declarations + SKILL.lock content pinning (dirhas"
"h) + idempotent skillmod sync,\nensuring every machine gets exactly the sa"
"me set of skills."

msgid "cli.root.short"
msgstr "go mod for Agent Skills: SKILL.mod declarations + SKILL.lock pinnin"
"g + sync alignment"

