msgid "cli.upgrade.long"
msgstr "Replace the running skillmod executable with a published release.\n"
"The download is verified against the release checksums.txt before it is in"
"stalled, so an upgrade follows the same trust path as a manual installatio"
"n.\nAn executable installed by a package manager should be upgraded throug"
"h that package manager instead.\nUse --check to report availability withou"
"t downloading, --tag to install a specific release, and --dry-run to downl"
"oad and verify without replacing the executable."

